{"parse": {"title": "Griffin (Reincarnation)", "pageid": 3893, "revid": 46545, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #22FF22; border-right: 4px solid #55FF55; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #00FF00 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #22FF22, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Meta Support Unit</span><br />This unit has one of the BEST supporting abilities in-game!<span style=\"font-size: 105%;\"></span></div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p><b>Griffin (Reincarnation)</b> is a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> unit. This unit is a part of <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Ascension)\" title=\"Griffin (Ascension)\">Griffin (Ascension)</a>, it is activated by sacrificing buff units.\n</p><p>He buffs all units' damage by 100%, including other users' units. His buff stacks with other buff units such as <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffc71e;\">Commander</span></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Dragon\" title=\"Wind Dragon\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) game-font-face\" style=\"color: #ffc71e;\">Wind Dragon</span></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elfy_(Sylph)\" title=\"Elfy (Sylph)\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Elfy (Sylph)</span></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Blossom\" title=\"Blossom\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #0d8cff;\">Blossom</span></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_(Soul_King)\" title=\"Skeleton (Soul King)\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Skeleton (Soul King)</span></a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(0, #76f1ff 30%, #fe56ff 50%, #ffec62 60%, #fe56ff 77%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Idol (Star)</span></a> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stats_Overview\">Stats Overview</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\" data-item-name=\"img\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-item-name=\"section1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOriginal Skin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" data-item-name=\"section1\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d6/Griffin_%28Reincarnation%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20250411111001\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation) (Pose)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d6/Griffin_%28Reincarnation%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20250411111001\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d6/Griffin_%28Reincarnation%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20250411111001 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d6/Griffin_%28Reincarnation%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20250411111001 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Griffin (Reincarnation) (Pose)\" width=\"270\" height=\"266\" data-image-key=\"Griffin_%28Reincarnation%29_%28Pose%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Griffin (Reincarnation) (Pose).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">“The time has come, for the reason of this world to change”</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"deployment_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Deployment Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">1,000¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"total_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Total Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">1,000¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgrade_levels\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Levels</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawn_cap\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Cap</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Tower_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tower Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ground BUFF</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Damage_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #38fcff; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa;\">Magic </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Magic\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212417\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Magic.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Magic.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Secondary_Damage_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Secondary Damage Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #fffbc9; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #c3c135, 0 0 2px #c3c135, 0 0 2px #c3c135;\">Light </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/22/Damage_type_Light.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113230903\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Light\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/22/Damage_type_Light.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113230903\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Light.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Light.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden game-font-face advanced-tooltip\" style=\"position: relative; user-select: none;z-index: 5;color: #ffffff8f;font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"dottedText C(#3a3a3a)-Th-L\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -43px; right: 0; cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted;\">Why do I have different stats?</div><div class=\"tooltip-contents\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Units in this game use a randomized system, where stats like damage are randomly rolled with about a 10% variance (like Dungeon Quest items). When you evolve a unit they also reroll their stats, but it will always be strictly better than the pre-evolved version.</div></div></div><div class=\"article-table mobileonly\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Frequently_Asked_Questions\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\">Why do I have different stats?</a></i><br /></div><div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; z-index: 5;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 124px; justify-content: flex-start; position: absolute; left: 234px; top: -48px; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;OFF mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;OFF\" style=\"display: none; transform: tran